{"id":"wb-7-1279","name":"清晖园","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"清晖园","text":"清晖园位于广东省佛山市顺德区大良街道清晖路23号，建于清嘉庆年间。为广东四大名园之一，岭南园林的代表。1989年被列入广东省文物保护单位名录（3-54），2013年3月被列入列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位，是国家AAAA级旅游景区。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B8%85%E6%99%96%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":93105884,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93105884","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ff3de4cba3822cc92add5b1f.jpg","title":"Foshan_Shunde_Qinghui_Yuan_2024-05-11_16.06.40.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Foshan_Shunde_Qinghui_Yuan_2024-05-11_16.06.40.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3d/Foshan_Shunde_Qinghui_Yuan_2024-05-11_16.06.40.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"古海岸遗址","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​清暉園，位於中國廣東省佛山市順德區大良街道中區社區清暉路23號。建於清代。屬於全國重點文物保護單位。","width":320,"height":240}}